{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/welcome_-_frame_at_0m2s.jpg?t=1742831401\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Enrich your life with real-life knowledge of plants, recipes, herbalism and more!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness the power of nature to rebuild your home in Out and About, a cozy foraging adventure! A storm has blown through the town of Portobello. To help this little community get back on its feet, you\u2019ll need to learn all about the wild surrounding landscape.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Learn to identify 100+ real life plants and fungi</strong> - knowledge that carries over into real life! Forage for food, cook supplies, and form deep friendships with the town's residents, who are slowly coming together as a community striving for sustainability.<br>   <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/PlantID.gif?t=1742831401\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cook delicious recipes and brew herbal remedies</strong> to help the townsfolk. All 150+ recipes in the game are real, and we'll give you step-by-step instructions on how to make them at home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/CookingGif2.gif?t=1742831401\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore an open natural world, </strong>from dense forests and wide grasslands to beautiful coastal beaches and wetlands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/Exploring2.gif?t=1742831401\" 